{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145832",
      "title": "Optimizing Data Fetching",
      "lectureOrder": 297,
      "videoOrder": 276,
      "sourceHash": "53b33024d0420fd7c0ae0552d1d44c6b6e50a4a86bb322a1502fbd44a630752e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.11,
          "end": 4.51,
          "en": "We implemented static generation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.51,
          "end": 8.42,
          "en": "on the index JS and the eventId JS pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.42,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "Now let's take a closer look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 13.75,
          "en": "It works, but maybe we can optimize it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.75,
          "end": 15.77,
          "en": "For example, on the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.77,
          "end": 17.76,
          "en": "so this index JS page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.76,
          "end": 22.76,
          "en": "We are pre generating this page with the pre fetched data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.03,
          "end": 23.905,
          "en": "so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.905,
          "end": 27.85,
          "en": "but of course this data will then only update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.85,
          "end": 29.63,
          "en": "if we build again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.63,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "So if our page was deployed for a couple of hours",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 37.24,
          "en": "or even days, and we have new featured events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.24,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "we need to redeploy our page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 42.57,
          "en": "to reflect that latest state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.57,
          "end": 43.91,
          "en": "That's not ideal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.91,
          "end": 46.99,
          "en": "And one possible work around could be to use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.99,
          "end": 49.64,
          "en": "getStaticProps instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.64,
          "end": 52.08,
          "en": "Then for every incoming request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.08,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "we would pre-render the page again on the fly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 58.06,
          "en": "but this would be overkill here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.06,
          "end": 62.9,
          "en": "We don't need to pre generate this for every request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.9,
          "end": 67.05,
          "en": "just a couple of times, maybe after a certain time span.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 71.77,
          "en": "And that's where we can add the revalidate key tutors object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.77,
          "end": 75.71000000000001,
          "en": "which we returned side-by-side to the props key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.71000000000001,
          "end": 77.98,
          "en": "And we can set this to a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.98,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "of our choice to 10 seconds, 100 seconds, 10 minutes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.17,
          "end": 85.21000000000001,
          "en": "whatever it makes sense to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.21000000000001,
          "end": 87.91,
          "en": "Now, our events and the featured events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.91,
          "end": 90.32,
          "en": "probably don't change that often.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.32,
          "end": 91.89,
          "en": "And it's not the end of the world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.89,
          "end": 93.74000000000001,
          "en": "if we did update them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.74000000000001,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "and our starting page, doesn't immediately reflect this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.82,
          "end": 102.82,
          "en": "So maybe every 1,800 seconds is a good time span.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.53,
          "end": 108.44,
          "en": "That means that every half hour we regenerate this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.44,
          "end": 111.1,
          "en": "for a new incoming request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.1,
          "end": 114.11,
          "en": "And I think that would work quite well here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.11,
          "end": 116.47,
          "en": "With that, this page still works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.47,
          "end": 119.81,
          "en": "but in production, it would be regenerated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.81,
          "end": 120.97,
          "en": "from time to time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.97,
          "end": 123.503,
          "en": "at most once every half hour.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.08,
          "end": 129.99,
          "en": "Now for eventId, we also could consider re-validating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.99,
          "end": 132.35,
          "en": "because there it's similar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.35,
          "end": 135.048,
          "en": "If the details about any event changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.048,
          "end": 137.73,
          "en": "we don't reflect this on our page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.73,
          "end": 140.34,
          "en": "because we never regenerate it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 144.06,
          "en": "Again, we could use service side rendering for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 146.95,
          "en": "or we add clients site data fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.95,
          "end": 148.82999999999998,
          "en": "so that we have some initial data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.82999999999998,
          "end": 152.336,
          "en": "and we then update this with the client site data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.336,
          "end": 157.336,
          "en": "But we could also go for re-validating instead here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 162.55,
          "en": "and here I will also set revalidate to a certain interval.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.55,
          "end": 165.11,
          "en": "Now, I will not go for half an hour here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.11,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "because for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 168.688,
          "en": "if the date changes, that's more important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.688,
          "end": 173.25,
          "en": "than the general list of featured events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 176.5,
          "en": "It's still okay if it's slightly outdated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.5,
          "end": 178.24,
          "en": "but I wanna be more accurate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.24,
          "end": 180.11,
          "en": "than on the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.11,
          "end": 183.8,
          "en": "So, set this, let's say to 30 seconds,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.8,
          "end": 186.84,
          "en": "so that if a new request comes in and it's more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.84,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "than 30 seconds since the page was last generated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.62,
          "end": 192.7,
          "en": "it will be generated again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.7,
          "end": 195.15,
          "en": "I think that's a setting that makes sense here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.15,
          "end": 197.65,
          "en": "Of course, you can also go for a different duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.65,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "if that makes more sense to you though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 202.46,
          "en": "or alternatively you solved as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.46,
          "end": 204.55,
          "en": "with client site data fetching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.55,
          "end": 208.12,
          "en": "in addition to the pre rendering here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.12,
          "end": 210.91,
          "en": "Now, I also have an optimization idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.91,
          "end": 213.36,
          "en": "regarding getStaticPaths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.36,
          "end": 216.82,
          "en": "Currently, we're fetching all events here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.82,
          "end": 217.82999999999998,
          "en": "Now, in our case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 219.97,
          "en": "that's only free events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.97,
          "end": 221.56,
          "en": "but on a real page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.56,
          "end": 224.94299999999998,
          "en": "we could of course have hundreds or thousands of events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.78,
          "end": 228.23,
          "en": "So fetching all those events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.23,
          "end": 231.14,
          "en": "to pre generate all those pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 231.14,
          "end": 234.18,
          "en": "could be a huge waste that might really",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 237.793,
          "en": "be redundant and could lead to performance issues.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.67000000000002,
          "end": 240.16,
          "en": "So in reality,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.16,
          "end": 244.57,
          "en": "we might want to just pre-render our featured events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 244.57,
          "end": 247.39,
          "en": "because those are more likely to be visited",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.39,
          "end": 249.763,
          "en": "because they're featured on the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.64,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "So therefore here, in eventId on this eventId page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 258.3,
          "en": "instead of fetching all events and pre rendering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.3,
          "end": 262.18,
          "en": "all the pages, all the detail pages for all events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.18,
          "end": 265.96,
          "en": "I will instead just load my featured events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 265.96,
          "end": 268.32,
          "en": "and therefore import getFeaturedEvents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 268.32,
          "end": 270.853,
          "en": "from the API util helper file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.72,
          "end": 277.72,
          "en": "and then just simply execute getFeaturedEvents down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 279.17,
          "end": 282.23,
          "en": "But now with that, of course, that implies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 282.23,
          "end": 287.23,
          "en": "that for some events, the page will not be pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.26,
          "end": 292.26,
          "en": "So if we leave fallback set to false, we'll have an issue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 292.64,
          "end": 296.62,
          "en": "If I click on some event, which was not, pre-generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.62,
          "end": 299.83,
          "en": "like this event with an idea of E1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 299.83,
          "end": 302.29,
          "en": "I get a 404 error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.29,
          "end": 305.7,
          "en": "even though we have data for this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 305.7,
          "end": 307.14,
          "en": "but we didn't define it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 307.14,
          "end": 310.1,
          "en": "in advance and therefore it wasn't pre-generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 310.1,
          "end": 314.13,
          "en": "And since we tell next.js that we did prepare",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.13,
          "end": 315.653,
          "en": "all required pages here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.653,
          "end": 320.36,
          "en": "that's what we tell next.js with fallback false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 320.36,
          "end": 323.47,
          "en": "It shows as a 404 page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 323.47,
          "end": 325.17,
          "en": "So the correct setting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.17,
          "end": 327.07,
          "en": "would be true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 327.07,
          "end": 330.28,
          "en": "telling next.js that there are more pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 330.28,
          "end": 332.223,
          "en": "than the ones we prepared here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 333.17,
          "end": 336.33,
          "en": "Then it will try to dynamically generate the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 336.33,
          "end": 341,
          "en": "if it encounters a page which was not pre-generated before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 341,
          "end": 344.54,
          "en": "Now, if we do that, it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.54,
          "end": 346.85,
          "en": "Now we see no event found initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 346.85,
          "end": 348.811,
          "en": "until the event was fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 348.811,
          "end": 352.79,
          "en": "because we are checking if we don't have any event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 352.79,
          "end": 356.40999999999997,
          "en": "And then we showed us fallback and that's good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.40999999999997,
          "end": 359.56,
          "en": "We should show a fallback content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 359.56,
          "end": 363.14,
          "en": "whilst we are waiting for the event to arrive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 363.14,
          "end": 366.01,
          "en": "but here it might be better to show some",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366.01,
          "end": 367.08,
          "en": "a loading spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 367.08,
          "end": 370.45,
          "en": "or some loading text instead of an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 370.45,
          "end": 373.81,
          "en": "Because here it's now actually expected for some events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 373.81,
          "end": 375.91,
          "en": "which haven't been pre-generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 375.91,
          "end": 378.84,
          "en": "that we don't have them right from the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 378.84,
          "end": 381.89,
          "en": "So instead of wrapping this into an error alert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 381.89,
          "end": 384.63,
          "en": "I'll wrap this in a regular div instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 384.63,
          "end": 389.36,
          "en": "and give that div a class name of center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.36,
          "end": 392.22,
          "en": "which is a globally available class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 392.22,
          "end": 394.793,
          "en": "to find in the global CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 396.37,
          "end": 401.37,
          "en": "And then I'll then say loading instead of no event found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.8,
          "end": 403.783,
          "en": "And therefore, now if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.783,
          "end": 407.13,
          "en": "we see loading until the event is there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 407.13,
          "end": 408.8,
          "en": "so that's better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408.8,
          "end": 410.34000000000003,
          "en": "Alternatively, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 410.34000000000003,
          "end": 415.03,
          "en": "we set fallback, not too true, but to blocking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 415.03,
          "end": 418.88,
          "en": "In that case, next.js will not serve anything",
